nt"},{"id":"yaoci-q-725c821248250976de1f","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-5232761de5a10e89f6e8","layer":"original","quote":"事毕，还启其母。母曰：“我喜汝有以报孔北海也","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-7677fe94726e4128470f","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-921f88c33e3abe15ece6","layer":"original","quote":"备敛容答曰〖17〗：“孔北海知世间有刘备邪！”即遣精兵三千人，随慈。贼闻兵至，解围散走","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":138,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-84c46e135f53dd7e9c27","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-921f88c33e3abe15ece6","layer":"original","quote":"遂到平原，说备曰：“慈，东莱之鄙人也〖13〗。与孔北海亲非骨肉，比非乡党〖14〗；特以名志相好〖15〗，有分灾共患之义。今管亥暴乱，北海被围；孤穷无援，危在旦夕！以君有仁义之名，能救人之急；故北海区区〖16〗，延颈恃仰，使慈冒白刃，突重围，从万死之中自托于君：惟君所以存之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-9325c809cf3ad903fd6a","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-13a25bda996994d95edb","layer":"original","quote":"北海相孔融闻而奇之〖1〗；数遣人讯问其母〖2〗，并致饷遗","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
